# Alchemy recipe spirit requirement

When creating or editing recipes in `src/ingredients.json`, follow the project skill `alchemy-recipe-spirit-required`:

for each recipe with cost more than 100 spirit must be required component

If `recipe_cost > 100`, include `spirit` in `ingredients`, recompute costs, then run:

```bash
python3 .cursor/skills/alchemy-recipe-cost/scripts/validate_recipe_costs.py
```
